abstract: "Version 16 of a work monograph with evidence apparatus on the FerrAI / Terra Nova / CIC complex. The manuscript reconstructs system architecture, operational process logic, claim/evidence governance, trigger order, and rights, patent, and utilization layers while distinguishing primary evidence, editorial inference, and open questions."
